ms of  universities because they served a  function perhaps they won't ever serve  that function again of being a place of  open-ended inquiry and discourse and  it's said that's migrated into places  that are more amenable to it well yeah I  hope that free and open conversation  just keeps going and I appreciate the  opportunity to have this one with you  for reason I'm Zach Weiss Muller and I'm  Nick Gillespie  you  [Music]  you
 

